Description: Document reader for Linux desktop
 Plato is a document reader supporting PDF, EPUB, CBZ, and DJVU formats.
 This package provides the desktop Linux version built with SDL2 for
 standard displays. It shares the same core functionality as the e-ink
 device version but is adapted for desktop use with mouse/keyboard input.
